  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Department - Community partnership to improve protection of Western Hoolock Gibbons (Hoolock hoolock) in Jeypore RF - Phase V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will accomplish the following objectives to help conserve endangered hoolock gibbons: (1) Continue the operations of three roving gibbon and wildlife patrol units consisting of community members and forest guards in each group; and, (2) Implement SMART patrolling protocols, systematically record patrol details, produce monthly reports and plan future patrols using these reports.</narrative>
  </description>
